{"title":"Silver Dagger","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Weapon Smithing Lv 16) · Monster drop: Werewolf, Dune Skirmisher, Hill Giant Behemoth, Pirate, Bandit +3 more</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-req\"><b>Requires</b> Lvl 15 · DEX 45 <span class=\"muted\">to equip</span></p>\n      <h2>Skill needed</h2><p>Wielding it takes the <a href=\"#/guide/special-attacks\"><b>Dagger</b> weapon skill</a>. <b>Archers</b> start with it. Everyone else can finish the quest <b><a href=\"#/guide/quest-the-mercy-knives\">The Mercy Knives</a></b> (Warden Maud Ferrow, level 11): free, and you keep the skill for good, or study a <b>Dagger tome</b> (1 skill point; vendors no longer sell them, so look on the Exchange).</p><p class=\"muted\">See <a href=\"#/guide/special-attacks\">Weapon skills &amp; specials</a> for how the skill levels and what it unlocks.</p>\n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Weapon Smithing at level 16 <span class=\"muted\">(338 XP)</span> from 3× <a href=\"#/item/silver-bar\">Silver Bar</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"kobold-chief\" title=\"Old Wickjaw - dropped it in 1 of 2 looted corpses (1/2)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/2a4c38ef4916af1ed50a.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Old Wickjaw</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"frost-giant\" title=\"Frost Giant - dropped it in 1 of 6 looted corpses (1/6)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/43020762332ab1de1a27.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Frost Giant</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/6<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"hill-giant-behemoth\" title=\"Hill Giant Behemoth - dropped it in 1 of 16 looted corpses (1/16)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/9c1502dd610dfce57688.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Hill Giant Behemoth</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/16<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"pirate\" title=\"Pirate - dropped it in 1 of 24 looted corpses (1/24)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/e5726af5787255560aab.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Pirate</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/24<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+4 more\">+4 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"bandit\" title=\"Bandit - dropped it in 1 of 132 looted corpses (1/132)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/0d647be846757b58c574.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bandit</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/132<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"dune-skirmisher\" title=\"Dune Skirmisher - dropped it in 1 of 300 looted corpses (1/300)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/dbfd07e1b3cf612d0e3f.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dune Skirmisher</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/300<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-butcher\" title=\"Ogre Butcher - dropped it in 1 of 945 looted corpses (1/945)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/2cf1b40edc5c1e611ef5.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Butcher</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/945<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"werewolf\" title=\"Werewolf - dropped it in 1 of 3,778 looted corpses (1/3,778)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/0ebf199ce603121d6b69.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Werewolf</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3,778<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"silver-dagger\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/weapon-smithing\">Weapon smithing</a></p>\n      <h2>Quality</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Quality\"><a class=\"q-chip q-all\" href=\"#/item/silver-dagger\">All</a><a class=\"q-chip q-inferior\" href=\"#/item/silver-dagger?q=inferior\">Inferior</a><a class=\"q-chip q-crude\" href=\"#/item/silver-dagger?q=crude\">Crude <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-shoddy\" href=\"#/item/silver-dagger?q=shoddy\">Shoddy <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/silver-dagger?q=ordinary\">Ordinary <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-good\" href=\"#/item/silver-dagger?q=good\">Good <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on q-excellent\" href=\"#/item/silver-dagger?q=excellent\">Excellent <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-superior\" href=\"#/item/silver-dagger?q=superior\">Superior</a><a class=\"q-chip q-flawless\" href=\"#/item/silver-dagger?q=flawless\">Flawless</a></div><div class=\"q-picker w-ench\" data-gear=\"silver-dagger\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Enchant\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip on\" data-wench=\"\">No enchant</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"destruction\">Destruction</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"burn\">Flame</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"freeze\">Freezing</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"shock\">Storm</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"corrode\">Corrosion</button></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">Quality scales this item’s own stats. Damage below is the weapon alone, before your stats and enchantments.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\" id=\"gearQTable\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Quality</th><th>Stats</th><th>This item</th><th>vs Ordinary</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"gearQRows\"><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/silver-dagger?q=inferior\" title=\"Show it at Inferior\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-inferior\" src=\"data/img/f78f5857775e32d41a00.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-inferior\">Inferior</span></td><td>-30%</td><td>2.7–5.4 damage</td><td>-1.7 avg</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/silver-dagger?q=crude\" title=\"Show it at Crude\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-crude\" src=\"data/img/f78f5857775e32d41a00.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-crude\">Crude</span></td><td>-20%</td><td>3.1–6.1 damage</td><td>-1.1 avg</td><td class=\"muted\">1 seen</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/silver-dagger?q=shoddy\" title=\"Show it at Shoddy\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-shoddy\" src=\"data/img/f78f5857775e32d41a00.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-shoddy\">Shoddy</span></td><td>-10%</td><td>3.5–6.9 damage</td><td>-0.6 avg</td><td class=\"muted\">1 seen</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/silver-dagger?q=ordinary\" title=\"Show it at Ordinary\"><td><img class=\"q-mini \" src=\"data/img/f78f5857775e32d41a00.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">Ordinary</span></td><td>0%</td><td>3.8–7.7 damage</td><td>0 avg</td><td class=\"muted\">3 seen</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/silver-dagger?q=good\" title=\"Show it at Good\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-good\" src=\"data/img/f78f5857775e32d41a00.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-good\">Good</span></td><td>+10%</td><td>4.2–8.4 damage</td><td>+0.6 avg</td><td class=\"muted\">1 seen</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/item/silver-dagger?q=excellent\" title=\"Show it at Excellent\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-excellent\" src=\"data/img/f78f5857775e32d41a00.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-excellent\">Excellent</span></td><td>+22%</td><td>4.7–9.4 damage</td><td>+1.3 avg</td><td class=\"muted\">2 seen</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/silver-dagger?q=superior\" title=\"Show it at Superior\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-superior\" src=\"data/img/f78f5857775e32d41a00.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-superior\">Superior</span></td><td>+30%</td><td>5–10 damage</td><td>+1.7 avg</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/silver-dagger?q=flawless\" title=\"Show it at Flawless\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-flawless\" src=\"data/img/f78f5857775e32d41a00.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-flawless\">Flawless</span></td><td>+38%</td><td>5.3–10.6 damage</td><td>+2.2 avg</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <h2>Getting Excellent ones</h2>\n      <p><b>Crafting</b> (Weapon Smithing 16): the higher above 16 you are, the better the odds, up to +30. <a href=\"#/calc-quality\" data-qe=\"silver-dagger\">Plan it on Quality &amp; enchanting</a></p>\n        <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table\"><thead><tr><th>Your level</th><th><span class=\"q-name q-inferior\">Inferior</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-crude\">Crude</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-shoddy\">Shoddy</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">Ordinary</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-good\">Good</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-excellent\">Excellent</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-superior\">Superior</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-flawless\">Flawless</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>16 <span class=\"muted\">(+0)</span></td><td>1.5%</td><td>4.0%</td><td>19.1%</td><td>56.2%</td><td>16.2%</td><td>2.9%</td><td>0.2%</td><td>~0%</td></tr><tr><td>21 <span class=\"muted\">(+5)</span></td><td>0.5%</td><td>2.4%</td><td>14.2%</td><td>55.7%</td><td>21.4%</td><td>5.1%</td><td>0.7%</td><td>~0%</td></tr><tr><td>26 <span class=\"muted\">(+10)</span></td><td>0.1%</td><td>1.2%</td><td>10.0%</td><td>52.7%</td><td>26.4%</td><td>7.8%</td><td>1.7%</td><td>~0%</td></tr><tr><td>31 <span class=\"muted\">(+15)</span></td><td>0.0%</td><td>0.4%</td><td>6.6%</td><td>47.5%</td><td>30.8%</td><td>11.1%</td><td>3.5%</td><td>0.1%</td></tr><tr><td>36 <span class=\"muted\">(+20)</span></td><td>0.0%</td><td>0.1%</td><td>3.9%</td><td>40.8%</td><td>33.7%</td><td>15.1%</td><td>5.9%</td><td>0.6%</td></tr><tr><td>39 <span class=\"muted\">(+23)</span></td><td>0.0%</td><td>0.0%</td><td>2.8%</td><td>36.3%</td><td>34.5%</td><td>17.5%</td><td>7.8%</td><td>1.2%</td></tr><tr><td>41 <span class=\"muted\">(+25)</span></td><td>0.0%</td><td>0.0%</td><td>2.0%</td><td>33.3%</td><td>35.0%</td><td>19.1%</td><td>9.0%</td><td>1.6%</td></tr><tr><td>46 <span class=\"muted\">(+30)</span></td><td>0.0%</td><td>0.0%</td><td>0.8%</td><td>25.7%</td><td>34.7%</td><td>22.7%</td><td>12.8%</td><td>3.3%</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      <p><b>Monster drops</b>: ordinary monsters and chests give at most Excellent; elites and bosses give Excellent or Superior. Since 27 Oct 2026 nothing drops Flawless: it is crafted only.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table\"><thead><tr><th>Dropped by</th><th>Qualities recorded</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-behemoth\">Gristlejaw</a> <span class=\"muted\">(incl. elites)</span></td><td><span class=\"q-name q-excellent\">Excellent</span> 1</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/monster/kobold-chief\">Gutterclaw</a></td><td><span class=\"q-name q-excellent\">Excellent</span> 1</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"silver-dagger\" data-map-quality=\"excellent\">Show where it drops Excellent on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Other m